Bugfix: Let the favourites star report its state

Marking a file as a favourite told assistive technology nothing: the star
swapped its icon but reported no state, and the name it announced kept its
previous value. Once the server answered, the row was drawn again and the
keyboard focus fell back to the top of the page. The star in the details
sidebar had no name at all, and both stars were links that led nowhere.

Both stars are buttons now. They keep the same name in either state, report
whether they are pressed, update that state as soon as they are toggled, and
keep the keyboard focus when the row or the sidebar is drawn again.

WCAG 2.1 AA, SC 4.1.2, SC 2.4.4
